    {
      "episode_number": 1,
      "title": "Handcuffed Case",
      "start_node_id": "e1_n01",
      "default_ambient": "luxury_lounge",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e1_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "8:47 PM · SafeKeep Storage Facility. You roll up the corrugated shutter of Unit 77. Inside sits only a titanium briefcase—handcuffed to a glowing satellite phone.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "lock_click",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n02",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "marco",
          "text": "Whoa!! We paid $400 for that unit and there’s a military-grade case inside?! Crack it open, Quinn!",
          "timestamp_label": "8:47 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n03"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n03",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "Hold on—the moment I snapped a photo of the case, the handcuffed phone buzzed with a text.",
          "timestamp_label": "8:48 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n04",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "u77",
          "text": "Put the briefcase down and close the shutter, Quinn. The motion sensor just triggered a 10-minute pickup.",
          "timestamp_label": "8:48 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n05"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n05",
          "type": "unsent_message",
          "sender_id": "u77",
          "text": "If the tamper seal breaks, the dye pack isn’t ink—it’s thermite.",
          "unsent_placeholder": "UNIT-77 unsent a message",
          "reveal_ms": 1700,
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n06_choice"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n06_choice",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "The storage facility’s front gate chimes open on Marco’s scanner:",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt_097_e1_free",
              "label": "Leave the case & slip out the side alley",
              "cost_type": "free",
              "badge_text": null,
              "player_reply_text": "Forget the $400, Marco—grab the bolt cutters and get to the truck!",
              "next_node_id": "e1_n07_free"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_097_e1_vip",
              "label": "Scan the barcode stamped on the briefcase",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "Secret · Watch Ad",
              "player_reply_text": null,
              "next_node_id": "e1_n07_vip"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n07_free",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You sprint toward Marco’s pickup—only to see a matte-black van slide silently across the exit lane, blocking your bumper.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "lock_click",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n08_free"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n08_free",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "marco",
          "text": "We’re boxed in!! Wait—why did the facility manager just walk out and wave the van straight toward Row C?!",
          "timestamp_label": "8:50 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n07_vip",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You scan the laser-etched serial number. It isn’t stolen cash—it’s a Federal Reserve Treasury printing plate reported missing from an armored transport last winter.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n08_vip"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n08_vip",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "marco",
          "text": "A Treasury printing plate?! That’s worth twenty million on the black market—no wonder they’re already at the gate!",
          "timestamp_label": "8:50 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n09_merge",
          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "u77",
          "duration_sec": 7,
          "transcript": "[van tires crunching gravel] \"Don’t run, Quinn. Our men just locked the perimeter fence. Step into the light with your hands up.\"",
          "audio_asset": null,
          "typing_delay_ms": 800,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n10"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n10",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "Headlights flood Row C, pinning you between two rows of steel shutters. Marco whispers: \"Unit 78 next door has a rusty padlock—we can cut through the drywall!\"",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "lock_click",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n11_cliff"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n11_cliff",
          "type": "cliffhanger",
          "headline": "Trapped In Row C",
          "teaser_text": "Three armed men just stepped out of the black van—and the storage manager is helping them hunt you down.",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_episode_number": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "episode_number": 2,
      "title": "Through The Wall",
      "start_node_id": "e2_n01",
      "default_ambient": "heartbeat",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e2_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "8:53 PM · You yank Unit 77’s shutter halfway down and kick through the thin partition into dark Unit 78. The handcuffed phone rings.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "lock_click",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n02",
          "type": "incoming_call",
          "caller_id": "u77",
          "caller_label": "UNIT-77",
          "ringtone_sfx": "call_ring",
          "ring_duration_ms": 12000,
          "can_decline": true,
          "on_answer_node_id": "e2_n03_ans",
          "on_decline_node_id": "e2_n03_dec"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n03_ans",
          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "u77",
          "duration_sec": 7,
          "transcript": "[footsteps right outside shutter] \"We hear you breathing in 78, Quinn. Hand back the case and you keep your life—plus $50,000 for your silence.\"",
          "audio_asset": null,
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n03_dec",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "u77",
          "text": "We know you kicked through to Unit 78. Slide the case out and take $50K—or we torch the row.",
          "timestamp_label": "8:53 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 500,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n04",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "marco",
          "text": "Look! Unit 78 is full of vintage motorcycles—and there’s a rooftop skylight right above that shelving rack!",
          "timestamp_label": "8:54 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n05"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n05",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "Wait—the bolt cutters are already crunching Unit 78’s padlock!",
          "timestamp_label": "8:54 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n06_choice"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n06_choice",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "The shutter begins rattling upward. Make your move:",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt_097_e2_free",
              "label": "Climb the shelves out the roof skylight",
              "cost_type": "free",
              "badge_text": null,
              "player_reply_text": "Up the rack, Marco! Leave the case and climb!",
              "next_node_id": "e2_n07_free"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_097_e2_vip",
              "label": "Activate Secret Service GPS on the case",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "Secret · Watch Ad",
              "player_reply_text": null,
              "next_node_id": "e2_n07_vip"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n07_free",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You burst through the dusty skylight onto the tin roof just as the shutter flies open below. Sirens wail two blocks away—someone on the street called in the break-in.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n08_free"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n08_free",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "marco",
          "text": "They’re grabbing the case and peeling out! Wait... you kept the handcuffed satellite phone?!",
          "timestamp_label": "8:57 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n07_vip",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You depress the recessed emergency pin beside the briefcase latch before climbing onto the roof. Instantly, a silent Secret Service beacon locks onto the van as it speeds off.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n08_vip"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n08_vip",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "Let them run, Marco—I just lit up a federal tracker inside that briefcase.",
          "timestamp_label": "8:57 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n09_merge",
          "type": "unsent_message",
          "sender_id": "marco",
          "text": "Don’t tell the cops I’m the one who tipped off the auction house about Unit 77.",
          "unsent_placeholder": "Marco unsent a message",
          "reveal_ms": 1700,
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n10"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n10",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You stare at Marco’s unsent message on the rooftop—then notice the satellite phone in your hand displaying one last incoming contact: \"Marco [Broker].\"",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n11_cliff"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n11_cliff",
          "type": "cliffhanger",
          "headline": "The Inside Co-Buyer",
          "teaser_text": "Unit 77 wasn’t a lucky auction win. Marco brought you here as the fall guy—and you’re still alone on the roof with him.",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_episode_number": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "episode_number": 3,
